<p>Your devotion to nature has made your body more attuned to the natural world and resistant to unnatural energies.</p><p>You gain <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>mindpower 100">28, 38, 46, 52, 58</acronym> Spell save, <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>mindpower 100">23%, 31%, 37%, 42%, 46%</acronym> Arcane resistance, and <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">5.8%, 12%, 16%, 19%, 22%</acronym> Nature damage affinity.</p><p>You defy arcane forces, so that any time you take damage from a spell, you restore <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>mindpower 100">4.3, 5.7, 6.9, 7.8, 8.7</acronym> Equilibrium each turn for <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">3, 4, 5, 6, 7</acronym> turns.</p><p>The effects increase with your Mindpower.</p>